 check before cutting as cut poles cannot be returned.\nThe alternative is the 240 cm used as supplied, giving 12.2 cm past each side but a little tight for curtains to clear the glass.\nPlease allow 9 cm at each end for the finials plus room to fit.\nBest wishes, Rob","questions":["Could you let me know what type of curtains you plan to hang"]},"fps":3}